      {
        "name": "Tentacle",
        "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[Melee Attack]: 4 (d8) and Restrained. If the Target is already Restrained this way, it is instead slammed into something and takes 7 (2d6) and must pass an [Endure] Save or be Dazed for 1 Round.</span></p>",
