      },
      {
        "name": "Otyugh Disease",
        "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">@UUID[Compendium.vagabond-app.active-effects.ActiveEffect.NZnOYlOxrYO1jJPF]{Otyugh Disease:} Beings that aren't Otyughs that are Sickened this way must pass an an [Endure] Save every day or lose 3 (d6) from their Max HP. This reduction to their Max HP lasts while they are Sickened by this disease.</span></p>",
